Source: nativmix
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Christian Möllmann <moellix@knoellix.net>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), python3-all, dh-python, hicolor-icon-theme
Standards-Version: 4.6.0

Package: nativmix
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-pyqt6, python3-pulsectl, python3-serial, python3-setproctitle, python3-mido, python3-rtmidi, python3-zeroconf, libnotify-bin
Description: Hardware-based PipeWire volume & MIDI mixer for Wayland
 Controls physical inputs, virtual sinks, and MIDI devices. (Modern deej alternative)